sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>API: POST /api/submissions/:id/approve<br/>Final match details, player stats and edits
    API->>DB: Read pending submission, teams and player accounts
    DB-->>API: Submission and current team/player data
    API->>DB: Save match stats, result news and approval atomically
    DB-->>API: Approval committed
    API-->>User: Approved submission
